{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a100000000000001","type":"group","x":-760,"y":-720,"width":1120,"height":760,"color":"4","label":"Project Reading Entry / 阅读入口"},
		{"id":"a100000000000002","type":"group","x":-760,"y":280,"width":4360,"height":720,"color":"5","label":"Component Communication / 父子组件通信"},
		{"id":"a100000000000003","type":"group","x":-760,"y":1240,"width":5280,"height":700,"color":"2","label":"Execution Order / 合法日期主流程"},
		{"id":"a100000000000004","type":"group","x":-760,"y":2180,"width":4320,"height":720,"color":"2","label":"Branch Flow / 支线流程"},
		{"id":"a100000000000005","type":"group","x":600,"y":-720,"width":2920,"height":760,"color":"3","label":"Parent Pages / 父组件差异"},
		{"id":"a100000000000006","type":"group","x":3840,"y":-720,"width":1360,"height":2580,"color":"1","label":"Key / Difficult Points"},
		{"id":"a100000000000007","type":"group","x":3840,"y":2060,"width":1360,"height":840,"color":"1","label":"Questions / Needs Confirmation"},
		{"id":"b100000000000001","type":"file","file":"ProjectInCompany/travelKnowledge/我的整理/Vue Components Communication 整理/功能点/DateRangeFilter 与父组件调用关系分析.md","x":-680,"y":-620,"width":360,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b100000000000002","type":"text","text":"## 一句话结论\n\n`DateRangeFilter` 自己不查数据。\n\n它只是帮父组件编辑两个日期：\n- 父组件持有真实 `startDate/endDate`\n- 子组件持有临时 `innerStartDate/innerEndDate`\n- 子组件校验后通过 `defineModel` 回写\n- 父组件 watcher 决定是否查接口","x":-220,"y":-620,"width":500,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b100000000000003","type":"text","text":"## 推荐阅读顺序\n\n1. 先看父子通信区：谁持有状态，谁只编辑。\n2. 再看主流程：合法日期如何触发列表查询。\n3. 再看支线：清空、非法日期、单边日期。\n4. 最后看父组件差异和难点。\n\n记忆线：\n父组件真实状态 -> 子组件临时编辑 -> 校验回写 -> 父组件查询。","x":-220,"y":-300,"width":500,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b100000000000010","type":"text","text":"## Parent Pages\n\nLayer:\n- Page / Container Component\n\nOwns:\n- `searchForm.startDate/endDate`\n- 或 `search.value.startDate/endDate`\n- `pagination`\n- table/card 列表数据\n\nTriggers:\n- watcher\n- 清空筛选\n- 分页/初始化\n\nRole:\n- 真正的状态持有者和业务决策者","x":-660,"y":400,"width":420,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b100000000000011","type":"text","text":"## Down: v-model + config\n\n通信类型：\n- 控制权 control authority\n- 可编辑值 editable value\n- 只读配置 value\n\n传给子组件：\n- `v-model:startDate`\n- `v-model:endDate`\n- `props.config`\n\n含义：\n父组件把当前日期值交给子组件编辑。","x":-40,"y":400,"width":420,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b100000000000012","type":"text","text":"## DateRangeFilter.vue\n\nLayer:\n- Business Block / 轻筛选组件\n\nOwns local state:\n- `innerStartDate`\n- `innerEndDate`\n- `mergedConfig`\n\nDoes:\n- 渲染两个 `t-date-picker`\n- watch 外部值并同步内部编辑态\n- `validateDateRange` 校验 start <= end\n- 非法时 warning 并清空结束日期","x":580,"y":400,"width":460,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b100000000000013","type":"text","text":"## Up: defineModel 回写\n\n通信类型：\n- action-like update\n- control authority return\n\n回写方式：\n- `startDate.value = innerStartDate.value`\n- `endDate.value = innerEndDate.value`\n\n本质：\n触发 `update:startDate` / `update:endDate`，让父组件真实状态更新。","x":1260,"y":400,"width":440,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b100000000000014","type":"text","text":"## Flow Back: 父组件查询\n\nParent receives:\n- 更新后的 `startDate/endDate`\n\nThen:\n- watcher 触发\n- `pagination.current = 1`\n- `fetchTableData` / `fetchData` / `fetchApprovalList`\n- 日期拼进接口参数\n- table/card 列表刷新\n\n子组件不拼参数、不请求接口。","x":1900,"y":400,"width":460,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000015","type":"text","text":"## 通信判断\n\n为什么适合 `v-model`：\n- 父组件持有真实值\n- 子组件负责编辑值\n- 编辑完成后把新值交回父组件\n\n比纯 `props + emit` 更短，也更贴合“可编辑输入组件”的语义。\n\n一句话：\n父级给值和控制权，子级只做输入、校验、回写。","x":2580,"y":400,"width":440,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b100000000000020","type":"text","text":"## Step 1: 用户选择日期\n\nTrigger:\n- 用户操作两个 `t-date-picker`\n\nChange:\n- 先改变子组件内部值\n- `innerStartDate`\n- `innerEndDate`\n\nOwner:\n- DateRangeFilter 临时编辑态","x":-660,"y":1360,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000021","type":"text","text":"## Step 2: 校验日期范围\n\nFunction:\n- `validateDateRange`\n\nCalls:\n- `parseDateValue`\n- `normalizeDateValue`\n\nCondition:\n- 两边日期都存在时，必须 `start <= end`。\n\nEffect:\n- 决定是否回写，或清空结束日期。","x":-80,"y":1360,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000022","type":"text","text":"## Step 3: 回写父组件\n\nWrite:\n- `startDate.value`\n- `endDate.value`\n\nMeaning:\n- `defineModel` 把子组件编辑结果交还父页面。\n\nState owner after write:\n- 仍然是父组件的 `searchForm/search`。","x":520,"y":1360,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000023","type":"text","text":"## Step 4: watcher 响应\n\nOwner:\n- 各父页面\n\nCommon action:\n- `pagination.current = 1`\n- 调列表请求函数\n\nWatch styles:\n- 日期数组 watch\n- 多字段数组 watch\n- deep watch `searchForm`","x":1120,"y":1360,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000024","type":"text","text":"## Step 5: API 参数转换\n\nParent decides:\n- 参数名叫什么\n- 结束日期是否补时间\n- 是否允许单边日期\n\nExamples:\n- `startTime/endTime`\n- `createTimeStart/createTimeEnd`\n- `createTimeFrom/createTimeTo`\n\nDateRangeFilter 不知道这些业务语义。","x":1720,"y":1360,"width":420,"height":360,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b100000000000025","type":"text","text":"## Step 6: 列表刷新\n\nResult:\n- `apiRewardPage`\n- `apiFeedBackPage`\n- `vehiclePage`\n- `getAuditLogPage`\n- `apiComplaintPage`\n- `getAllFormPage`\n\nUI:\n- table 或 card 列表显示新的筛选结果。","x":2360,"y":1360,"width":380,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000026","type":"text","text":"## Flow Explanation: 主流程\n\nType:\n- Main Flow\n\nTrigger:\n- 用户选择合法开始/结束日期。\n\nOrdered steps:\n1. 日期选择器写入内部编辑态。\n2. `validateDateRange` 校验通过。\n3. `defineModel` 回写父组件。\n4. 父组件 watcher 重置分页。\n5. 父组件请求接口。\n6. 列表刷新。\n\nReturn / End:\n- 停在新列表渲染结果，等待下一次筛选。","x":2960,"y":1360,"width":460,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b100000000000030","type":"text","text":"## Branch 1: 清空筛选\n\nTrigger:\n- 父组件点击 `handleClearSearch`\n\nSteps:\n1. 父组件把 `startDate/endDate` 置空。\n2. 父组件可能主动 fetch。\n3. DateRangeFilter watch 到外部空值。\n4. 清空 `innerStartDate/innerEndDate`。\n5. 日期选择器 UI 清空。\n\nRisk:\n- 主动 fetch + watcher 可能形成双触发。","x":-660,"y":2300,"width":460,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000031","type":"text","text":"## Branch 2: start > end\n\nTrigger:\n- 用户选出非法日期范围。\n\nSteps:\n1. `validateDateRange` 判断非法。\n2. `MessagePlugin.warning` 提示。\n3. `innerEndDate = ''`。\n4. 回写新的 `startDate` 和空 `endDate`。\n5. 父组件 watcher 触发查询。\n\nResult:\n- 父组件的 `endDate` 可能是子组件校验后清空的。","x":20,"y":2300,"width":480,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000032","type":"text","text":"## Branch 3: 单边日期\n\nCondition:\n- 只选开始日期，或只选结束日期。\n\nDateRangeFilter:\n- 允许单边日期存在。\n- 只有两边都存在且 `start > end` 才非法。\n\nParent pages:\n- 多数页面会传单边日期。\n- `sysLogList.vue` 要开始和结束都存在才传日期参数。\n\nConclusion:\n- 通用校验在子组件，业务查询策略在父组件。","x":720,"y":2300,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000033","type":"text","text":"## Branch 4: approval 路由恢复\n\nTrigger:\n- `route.query.formId / bizType`\n\nSteps:\n1. `openApprovalDetailFromRoute` 执行。\n2. 父组件清空 `search.startDate/endDate`。\n3. `fetchApprovalList({ bizTypeList })`。\n4. DateRangeFilter watch 到外部值变化。\n5. 日期选择器同步清空。\n\nNote:\n- 这不是 DateRangeFilter 主动触发，但会影响它。","x":1480,"y":2300,"width":500,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b100000000000034","type":"text","text":"## Branch Flow Summary\n\n清空筛选：\n- 父组件控制子组件。\n\n非法日期：\n- 子组件有局部校验权，会修正父状态。\n\n单边日期：\n- 子组件允许，父组件决定接口策略。\n\n路由恢复：\n- 父组件外部逻辑改变日期，子组件跟随同步。","x":2220,"y":2300,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b100000000000040","type":"text","text":"## 默认参数名页面\n\n`rewardPunish/index.vue`\n- `startTime/endTime`\n- 单独 watch 日期数组\n\n`jobFeedback/index.vue`\n- `createTimeStart/createTimeEnd`\n- deep watch `searchForm`\n\n`complaint/index.vue`\n- `createTimeStart/createTimeEnd`\n- deep watch `searchForm`","x":720,"y":-600,"width":500,"height":480,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b100000000000041","type":"text","text":"## 自定义 label / 时间边界\n\n`vehicle/index.vue`\n- label: 使用时间\n- 列表补 `00:00:00` / `23:59:59`\n- 导出传原始日期\n\n`sysLogList.vue`\n- label: 操作时间\n- 两个日期都存在才传\n- `endDate + 1 day`","x":1440,"y":-600,"width":520,"height":480,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b100000000000042","type":"text","text":"## approval 页面差异\n\n`approval/index.vue`\n- state: `search.value.startDate/endDate`\n- label: 创建日期\n- 允许只传开始或只传结束\n- `createTimeTo = addOneDay(endDate)`\n- 列表返回后进入 `approvalList`\n- `filteredList computed` 渲染卡片\n\nSpecial:\n- 路由恢复逻辑会主动清空日期。","x":2180,"y":-600,"width":560,"height":480,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b100000000000050","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 双状态同步\n\nWhy hard:\n- 父组件真实值和子组件副本同时存在。\n\nEvidence:\n- 父 -> 子：watch 同步外部值。\n- 子 -> 父：`validateDateRange` 回写 `defineModel`。\n\nRisk:\n- 初学者容易误以为 `innerStartDate` 才是真实筛选条件。\n\nHow to read:\n- 真实筛选状态永远看父组件的 `searchForm/search`。","x":4000,"y":-600,"width":1040,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b100000000000051","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: validateDateRange 职责偏多\n\nNow it does:\n1. 解析日期。\n2. 判断合法性。\n3. 修正内部结束日期。\n4. 回写父组件。\n\nRisk:\n- 以后加快捷日期、禁用范围、默认区间时会变复杂。\n\nPossible split:\n- `isInvalidRange`\n- `normalizeRange`\n- `commitRangeToParent`","x":4000,"y":-160,"width":1040,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b100000000000052","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 清空筛选双触发\n\nPattern:\n- `handleClearSearch` 修改 `searchForm`\n- 然后主动 fetch\n- watcher 也可能因为字段变化再 fetch\n\nCurrent mitigation:\n- 多数页面有 `loading` guard。\n\nCleaner choices:\n- A：清空函数只改状态，统一交给 watcher 查询。\n- B：清空函数主动查，watcher 对清空流程做抑制。","x":4000,"y":280,"width":1040,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b100000000000053","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 日期边界不统一\n\nDifferent handling:\n- `vehicle`: 补 `23:59:59`\n- `sysLog`: `endDate + 1 day`\n- `approval`: `endDate + 1 day`\n- 其他页面：直接传原始结束日期\n\nRisk:\n- 列表和导出结果可能不一致。\n\nSuggestion:\n- 整理“日期范围传参规范”：闭区间还是半开区间、结束日期是否包含当天。","x":4000,"y":720,"width":1040,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b100000000000054","type":"text","text":"## Difficult Point: 隐式 Vue import\n\nDocument note:\n- `DateRangeFilter.vue` 显式 import 了 `computed`\n- 但使用了 `ref` / `watch`\n\nIf auto-import exists:\n- 没问题。\n\nIf not:\n- 组件会报错。\n\nSafer import:\n```js\nimport { computed, ref, watch } from 'vue';\n```","x":4000,"y":1180,"width":1040,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b100000000000060","type":"text","text":"## Needs Confirmation: 源码未在当前 vault 找到\n\n我在当前 Obsidian vault 内搜索了：\n- `DateRangeFilter.vue`\n- 六个父页面路径\n\n结果：\n- 没找到对应源码文件。\n\n因此这张图基于当前 Markdown 笔记里的分析结论绘制，不是重新逐行核验源码后的最终结论。","x":4000,"y":2200,"width":1040,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b100000000000061","type":"text","text":"## Where To Modify / 改代码先看哪里\n\n改日期输入和校验：\n- `DateRangeFilter.vue`\n- `validateDateRange`\n- `watch(() => [startDate.value, endDate.value])`\n\n改查询参数：\n- 各父页面的 fetch 方法\n\n改触发时机：\n- 各父页面 watcher 和 `handleClearSearch`\n\n改结束日期规则：\n- 父页面的参数转换处，不在子组件里统一猜。","x":4000,"y":2520,"width":1040,"height":280,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
